 lines represent the 95% limits of agreement ( &#x000b1; 2sd).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TOORTHJ-2-86_F1"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>The Test-Retest Mean &#x000b1; SE of Grip and Pinch Strength (in kg Force) in with Primary Osteoarthritis of the Hand Patients (POAH) and Healthy Subjects</p></caption><table frame="border" rules="all" width="100%"><thead><tr><th colspan="4" rowspan="1">Healthy Subjects</th><th colspan="4" rowspan="1">POAH Patients</th><th rowspan="3" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">Left Hand</th><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">Right Hand</th><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">Left Hand</th><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">Right Hand</th></tr><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 1</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 2</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test 1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.7 &#x000b1; 0.9</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.4 &#x000b1; 0.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20.8 &#x000b1; 1.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20.3 &#x000b1; 1.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15.0 &#x000b1; 1.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">15.1 &#x000b1; 1.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">17.8 &#x000b1; 1.3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18.6 &#x000b1; 1.3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Grip</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.7 &#x000b1; 0.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.6 &#x000b1; 0.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.9 &#x000b1; 0.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.8 &#x000b1; 0.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.1 &#x000b1; 0.2</td><td align="center" r